2.2.12 Oct 12 2026
* noisegainmef / crawlnoisegain: much lower memory use (2-4x less peak memory, more for large detectors).
  Only the statistics windows of the images are read and decompressed; archive downloads are spooled to a
  temporary file instead of being held in memory.
* crawlnoisegain: archive queries failed for string readmodes (HTTP 400); fixed. Failed OpenSearch queries
  are now retried for transient errors, reported clearly, and only skip the affected date / camera type.
  The crawler exits with code 1 if any query failed.
* New flat field comparison tool (flatcomp) to compare daily flats against master flats from the archive.
* submit_sophia_observation: --defocus and --exptimes accept multiple values (all combinations are
  submitted), new --tel option. Note: --exptime was renamed to --exptimes.
* trim_muscat_calibs: option -notrim renamed to --notrim.
* Fix spelling throughout code, help texts and documentation; fix a log message that failed to format in
  submitNameModeTest.
* Rename Changenotes to CHANGELOG; add CLAUDE.md with a codebase overview.

